{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011CebU13YUJQpYthziFKaMe","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Done! All tests pass. The issue was with nested f-strings inside t-strings not being tokenized correctly. \n\nThe fix involved properly saving and restoring the `is_template` flag when entering and leaving nested f-strings, and ensuring that token type conversion only happens for the outermost t-string tokens, not for nested f-string tokens. The key changes were:\n\n1. **Extended the stack to save is_template**: Changed `fstring_prefix_quote_stack` from storing 2-tuples to 3-tuples `(prefix, quote, is_template)`\n2. **Reordered initialization**: Moved `push_fstring_prefix_quote` call before setting `is_template` so the old value is saved\n3. **Deferred is_template restoration**: Made the `fstring_end` token generation defer restoring `is_template` until after the token is made, preventing incorrect conversion\n4. **Added conditional conversion logic**: Modified `make_token` to only convert `fstring_*` to `tstring_*` when the prefix contains \"t\"\n5. **Fixed prefix handling**: Saved and temporarily restored the prefix during token generation for the outermost f-string end to ensure correct type assignment\n\nAll 3 tests pass with 100% coverage on test files."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":8,"cache_creation_input_tokens":628,"cache_read_input_tokens":85804,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":628},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"54e9d7c1-1345-5e2d-ba67-93201e1134e8","uuid":"482ef3a0-63af-4f8a-8fdd-48abfd7b83ed","timestamp":"2026-08-31T20:35:21.026Z","request_id":"req_011CebU12C7Naj3kQ2SmS12i"}
